00:26:36.240 --> 00:26:37.600
and isn't done right

00:26:37.600 --> 00:26:40.140
that there's just no way I can recommend it today.

00:26:40.580 --> 00:26:43.060
I'd be crazy to tell somebody, you know,

00:26:43.060 --> 00:26:45.660
hey, forget what you're doing, go home,

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:46.860
play Mighty Bomb Jack,

00:26:47.040 --> 00:26:48.820
because it's just, like, we're,

00:26:48.940 --> 00:26:53.000
even in 1987, like, we were above that on the NES.

00:26:53.040 --> 00:26:55.360
You know, like, we have better games now.

00:26:55.740 --> 00:26:57.200
We had better games then,

00:26:57.220 --> 00:27:00.760
